  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "PROPERTY HIGHLIGHTS:<br>- WaterColor Beach Club and Community Pool Passes Included in Rental (Maximum Allotted Wristband Qty is 12) <br>- Oversized Pool With Large Layout Deck With Two Pool Loungers & Swimming Lap Lane (Complimentary Pool Heating Available October 1-May 1)<br>- 6 Passenger Street Legal Electric Cart<br>- 6 Adult Bikes Included in Rental<br>- Parking For 3 Cars (Garage Access Not Available)<br>- Built In Gas Grill <br>- Commerical Ice Machine<br>- Additional Fridge<br>- Exterior Shower<br>- 2 Minute Bike Ride to Camp WaterColor<br>- 5 Minute Golf Cart Ride to WaterColor Beach Club <br>- 6 Minute Golf Cart Ride to Seaside<br><br>DETAILS:<br>Welcome to 410 Pine Needle Way, your ultimate luxury getaway just two blocks from Camp WaterColor and a mile from the beautiful WaterColor Beach Club. This stunning home features pristine interiors and thoughtfully curated design, creating an inviting atmosphere for relaxation and celebration.<br><br>As you approach, a spacious front porch beckons you to unwind and enjoy the coastal breeze. Inside, the open-concept living area seamlessly connects the chef's kitchen, living room, and dining space, perfect for family gatherings. This level also includes a cozy guestroom with a queen bed and private bathroom, along with a convenient half-bathroom.<br><br>Upstairs, the master suite is a luxurious retreat with a king bed, French doors leading to a second-floor porch, and a spa-like ensuite bathroom featuring a soaking tub and walk-in shower. A second guest bedroom on this floor boasts a king bed and private bathroom.<br><br>The third floor is a playful oasis for kids, featuring eight twin beds, a separate living area, and a shared bathroom, providing the perfect hangout space.<br><br>Outside, enjoy the expansive porches and a private pool, ideal for sunny afternoons and evening barbecues. With a 6-passenger electric cart and six adult bikes included, exploring the vibrant WaterColor community is a breeze.<br><br>At 410 Pine Needle Way, you'll find the perfect blend of luxury and comfort, ready to create unforgettable memories with loved ones on your next Gulf Coast escape.<br><br>FIRST FLOOR:<br>- Guest Bedroom: Queen Bed (2), Private Bathroom with Walk in Shower<br>- Kitchen<br>- Living Room<br>- Dining Room<br>- Half Bath<br><br>SECOND FLOOR:<br>- Master Bedroom: King Bed (2), Private Bathroom with Walk In Shower and Soaking Tub<br>- Master Bedroom: King Bed (2), Private Bathroom with Walk In Shower<br>- Laundry Area<br><br>THIRD FLOOR (OPEN LAYOUT):<br>- Four Twin Beds (4), Shared Bathroom with Walk In Shower<br>- Four Twin Beds (4), Shared Bathroom with Walk In Shower<br>- Second Living/Gaming Area",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Limited Time March Savings | Private Pool, Electric Cart, Bikes & Beach Club Access"
        }
      ],
