            "id": "ff3c6889-2a23-4303-8122-1debfe5d8283",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "We are delighted that you enjoyed your stay with us in Watercolor at this beautiful home! The home and amenities are truly wonderful and we are so happy you approved! Thank you for posting your review and we look forward to your next stay with us on 30A!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "We loved this home. Everything from the floor plan to the thoughtful bells and whistles (hello second fridge and ice machine near the pool and kitchen)!\nIt was perfect for our family - children range in age from 3-23 and we all thoroughly enjoyed the interior and outside spaces.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Amazing property",
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Erin M.",
        "date": "2024-03-28T19:05:23Z",
        "id": "6605bf73dc27343d657a9924",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Fantastic home for two families (total of 11 people) to stay for spring break! Lacked nothing! Great location. Property management company was VERY responsive to a couple questions. Super easy checkout as well....which is always a plus!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Great Spring Break!",
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Keri W.",
        "date": "2024-04-07T00:41:29Z",
        "id": "6611ebbab9191f35c70886a4",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Our group of 4 adults and 7 kids (ages 4-12) had a very fun Spring Break stay. The house had great space for all of us and we loved that it was walkable to Camp Watercolor. The pool at the house was a nice size (we were glad we paid the extra to have it heated!), the kitchen was well stocked and very organized, and the outdoor space was great for hanging. I contacted maintenance for a couple small issues and they had someone to the house in less than an hour both times. We would absolutely stay here again.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Perfect Spring Break home for two families",
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Kelsey B.",
        "date": "2022-05-09T15:05:09Z",
        "id": "6285777273c30423b18b91a1",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
