        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Oct 21, 2022",
            "id": "a58662cf-badc-442b-aa06-ea92852a5f07",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you so much for your 5-star review! We are so pleased to hear that you had a wonderful, beach vacation at the lovely 410 Pine Needle Way! Customer service is very important to us, and we are so happy you had such a great experience. We truly appreciate the feedback from your experience with us! We look forward to having you back down soon on 30-A..",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "We absolutely love Watercolor, and had another amazing time. The home is perfect for families, the pool, golf cart and location are ideal! Sanders was great to work with as well. Only issue we had was with showers - water would go from hot to cold and back again the whole time. We also wish there were pool towels at the home. Other than those, amazing place!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Another Great Watercolor Trip!",
        "verified": true
      }
